expertly...

1750
01:19:30.432 --> 01:19:33.376
carefully took the entire
top off of that tower?

1751
01:19:34.019 --> 01:19:34.836
Yes.

1752
01:19:34.979 --> 01:19:36.752
You know the rules.
This isn't a toy.

1753
01:19:37.022 --> 01:19:39.716
- Um, well, it kind of is.
- No.

1754
01:19:39.858 --> 01:19:43.462
Actually, it's a highly sophisticated
interlocking brick system.

1755
01:19:43.612 --> 01:19:45.965
- But we bought it at the toy store.
- We did.

1756
01:19:46.115 --> 01:19:49.219
But the way I'm using it
makes it an adult thing.

1757
01:19:49.368 --> 01:19:51.470
The box for this one
said ages 8 to 14.

1758
01:19:51.620 --> 01:19:55.725
That's a suggestion.
They have to put that on there.

1759
01:19:55.874 --> 01:19:59.194
You can't expect me to be able
to resist playing with all this.

1760
01:19:59.336 --> 01:20:01.689
You have your stuff over near
the Christmas decorations.

1761
01:20:02.172 --> 01:20:04.366
All those bricks, you can
build anything you want.

1762
01:20:07.970 --> 01:20:11.324
Finn, we're gonna play a
little game. It's called:

1763
01:20:11.473 --> 01:20:14.372
"Let's Put Everything Back
the Way You Found it."

1764
01:20:14.518 --> 01:20:16.120
But, Dad, you don't understand.

1765
01:20:16.270 --> 01:20:19.465
So I can make things the way
they're supposed to be.

1766
01:20:22.609 --> 01:20:24.131
Permanently.

1767
01:20:27.114 --> 01:20:28.466
<i>More Kragles?</i>

1768
01:20:28.615 --> 01:20:31.218
This rebellion ends right now.

1769
01:20:31.368 --> 01:20:32.845
Commencing...

1770
01:20:32.995 --> 01:20:34.267
micro-management.

1771
01:20:38.709 --> 01:20:40.436
Oh, no. No!

1772
01:20:45.466 --> 01:20:47.113
Ha, ha! Fire in the hole!

1773
01:20:51.430 --> 01:20:52.497
Wait, what's happening?

1774
01:20:52.639 --> 01:20:55.413
No, wait! No, we're going
down! Mayday!

1775
01:20:55.559 --> 01:20:57.036
<i>No!</i>

1776
01:20:58.354 --> 01:20:59.421
Meow. Meow.

1777
01:20:59.563 --> 01:21:01.506
Hold on, Jeff.
We're coming for you!

1778
01:21:01.648 --> 01:21:02.465
No!

1779
01:21:02.608 --> 01:21:03.334
<i>Stop!</i>

1780
01:21:03.942 --> 01:21:04.793
<i>Oh, no!</i>

1781
01:21:14.286 --> 01:21:16.263
Arr, there be too
many Micro-managers!

1782
01:21:16.413 --> 01:21:17.953
<i>What am I holding here?</i>

1783
01:21:17.956 --> 01:21:20.900
- It's a battleship.
- No, it's a hodgepodge. That's what it is.

1784
01:21:21.043 --> 01:21:22.360
What's Batman doing on it?

1785
01:21:23.087 --> 01:21:24.530
What is this, a robot pirate?

1786
01:21:25.589 --> 01:21:26.281
Dang it.

1787
01:21:27.800 --> 01:21:29.197
<i>Stop! Stop it!
No! Stop it! Stop!</i>

1788
01:21:29.343 --> 01:21:31.445
You got glue all over
that construction worker.

1789
01:21:32.805 --> 01:21:34.907
Here. Give that to me.

1790
01:21:35.557 --> 01:21:37.659
<i>Stop it! Stop it! Stop it!</i>

1791
01:21:37.810 --> 01:21:39.550
<i>All of those are my
friends! No, stop it!</i>

1792
01:21:39.603 --> 01:21:42.798
Ye were a hearty crew. But it be...

1793
01:21:43.524 --> 01:21:45.376
It be over.

1794
01:21:45.526 --> 01:21:47.469
No!

1795
01:21:50.197 --> 01:21:51.640
<i>The Piece of Resistance!</i>

1796
01:21:51.782 --> 01:21:53.384
<i>I can still save them!</i>

1797
01:21:53.534 --> 01:21:57.059
Let's get this gunk off
this construction worker.

1798
01:21:57.204 --> 01:21:59.602
He's not just a construction
worker, Dad. He's the hero.

1799
01:21:59.748 --> 01:22:01.521
Nope, he's not.

1800
01:22:01.667 --> 01:22:04.361
He is a ordinary, regular...

1801
01:22:04.503 --> 01:22:06.196
generic construction worker...

1802
01:22:06.338 --> 01:22:09.157
and I need to put him
back where he belongs.

1803
01:22:10.300 --> 01:22:13.279
Now, where is my X-Acto knife?

1804
01:22:16.014 --> 01:22:18.742
<i>I gotta get the Piece
of Resistance.</i>

1805
01:22:19.393 --> 01:22:22.622
<i>If I could get the attention
of the smaller creature...</i>

1806
01:22:23.272 --> 01:22:24.464
<i>I gotta move.</i>

1807
01:22:24.606 --> 01:22:26.834
Where is that?

1808
01:22:26.984 --> 01:22:28.882
<i>Move!</i>

1809
01:22:37.119 --> 01:22:38.516
All right.

1810
01:23:00.434 --> 01:23:01.126
<i>Move!</i>

1811
01:23:06.607 --> 01:23:08.050
Now, I didn't move...

1812
01:23:12.196 --> 01:23:12.888
<i>Ow.</i>

1813
01:23:15.574 --> 01:23:16.971
- Uh, Dad?
- Yeah.

1814
01:23:17.117 --> 01:23:20.187
I think I saw the X-Acto over
there near Middle Zealand.

1815
01:23:20.329 --> 01:23:21.772
Oh, great. Thank you.

1816
01:23:21.914 --> 01:23:23.186
Welcome.

1817
01:23:30.923 --> 01:23:32.616
It's up to you now, Emmet.

1818
01:23:42.392 --> 01:23:43.835
<i>Believe.</i>

1819
01:23:44.978 --> 01:23:47.501
<i>I know that sounds
like a cat poster...</i>

1820
01:23:47.648 --> 01:23:49.341
<i>but it's true.</i>

1821
01:23:56.365 --> 01:23:58.593
<i>Whoa!</i>

1822
01:24:11.296 --> 01:24:12.397
Sorry, street.

1823
01:24:18.220 --> 01:24:19.617
Ho-ho!

1824
01:24:24.643 --> 01:24:27.496
I can see everything.

1825
01:24:31.024 --> 01:24:31.716
Ha, ha!

1826
01:24:31.858 --> 01:24:33.426
What the heck is this?

1827
01:24:33.569 --> 01:24:35.717
I am a MasterBuilder.

1828
01:24:38.323 --> 01:24:41.142
Release every
Micro-manager we have!

1829
01:24:41.285 --> 01:24:42.978
Let's get him, fellas!

1830
01:24:46.873 --> 01:24:48.145
Hey, everyone!

1831
01:24:48.292 --> 01:24:50.269
- Emmet!
- Emmet! Yay!

1832
01:24:53.171 --> 01:24:55.820
Lucy, I'm going inside that thing.

1833
01:24:56.258 --> 01:24:57.325
You've got it, Emmet.

1834
01:24:57.467 --> 01:25:00.116
Take that! Ha, ha!

1835
01:25:00.262 --> 01:25:01.534
Good night! Come here!

1836
01:25:01.680 --> 01:25:03.407
We'll help you out, kid.

1837
01:25:03.557 --> 01:25:06.160
Here's how we do it pirate-style!

1838
01:25:08.770 --> 01:25:09.750
Yes! Emmet! That's it!

1839
01:25:12.899 --> 01:25:13.841
Take him down, boys!

1840
01:25:17.654 --> 01:25:18.755
Emmet!

1841
01:25:21.241 --> 01:25:22.968
Stay positive.

1842
01:25:23.994 --> 01:25:25.266
They're tearing me apart!

1843
01:25:26.079 --> 01:25:27.897
Stay positive.

1844
01:25:28.206 --> 01:25:29.023
Come on!

1845
01:25:29.333 --> 01:25:30.855
Oh, forget it!

1846
01:25:36.298 --> 01:25:39.072
You all need to be more friendly!

1847
01:25:41.595 --> 01:25:42.696
Emmet, go!

1848
01:25:42.846 --> 01:25:44.038
Go! Now's your...

1849
01:25:44.181 --> 01:25:45.721
- chance!
- She's right!

1850
01:25:45.807 --> 01:25:48.751
- You can do it, me laddie!
- Go on, kid. Get in there!

1851
01:25:56.318 --> 01:25:57.418
Sir, we got an intrud...!

1852
01:25:59.237 --> 01:26:00.463
Lord Business.

1853
01:26:00.614 --> 01:26:02.387
Back from the dead, Brickowski?

1854
01:26:02.532 --> 01:26:03.758
Well, you're too late!

1855
01:26:03.909 --> 01:26:05.386
Skeletrons, get him!

1856
01:26:16.254 --> 01:26:17.901
Argh! I can't move!

1857
01:26:18.924 --> 01:26:20.196
You see, your friends...

1858
01:26:20.342 --> 01:26:21.402
<i>oh, they're finished!</i>

1859
01:26:22.511 --> 01:26:23.828
<i>My world is almost finished.</i>

1860
01:26:25.347 --> 01:26:28.041
The last thing I need
to do is finish...

1861
01:26:28.183 --> 01:26:29.751
- ...you.
- No, stop! Please!

1862
01:26:29.893 --> 01:26:32.621
If you do one more thing, I'm
gonna unleash my secret weapon.

1863
01:26:33.188 --> 01:26:34.505
Your secret weapon?

1864
01:26:35.148 --> 01:26:37.626
Yes, it's called:

1865
01:26:37.776 --> 01:26:39.878
The Power of The Special.

1866
01:26:40.028 --> 01:26:41.380
That sounds dumb.

1867
01:26:42.072 --> 01:26:45.551
All right, here it comes.
My secret weapon...

1868
01:26:46.410 --> 01:26:47.853
is this.

1869
01:26:49.037 --> 01:26:51.731
What is that? Is it super small?
I don't see anything.

1870
01:26:51.873 --> 01:26:54.146
It's my hand. I want
you to take it.

1871
01:26:54.292 --> 01:26:55.769
You want me to take your hand off?

1872
01:26:55.919 --> 01:26:58.693
No, I want you to join me.

1873
01:26:59.047 --> 01:27:02.242
Look at all of these
things that people built.

1874
01:27:02.426 --> 01:27:03.823
You might see a mess...

1875
01:27:03.969 --> 01:27:06.697
Exactly. And a bunch of
weird, dorky stuff...

1876
01:27:06.847 --> 01:27:09.200
that ruined my
perfectly good stuff!

1877
01:27:10.058 --> 01:27:12.035
Okay. What I see...

1878
01:27:12.436 --> 01:27:15.710
<i>are people inspired
by each other...</i>

1879
01:27:16.148 --> 01:27:17.670
<i>and by you.</i>

1880
01:27:18.692 --> 01:27:21.341
<i>People taking what you made...</i>

1881
01:27:21.778 --> 01:27:24.131
<i>and making something new out of it.</i>

1882
01:27:40.505 --> 01:27:42.323
Finn, did you make all of this?

1883
01:27:45.010 --> 01:27:47.704
The people are trying to
stop President Business...

1884
01:27:47.846 --> 01:27:49.823
from using the Kragle.

1885
01:27:50.557 --> 01:27:52.000
What's the Kragle?

1886
01:27:52.601 --> 01:27:55.454
Um, it's in there.

1887
01:27:57.522 --> 01:27:59.124
In here?

1888
01:28:36.978 --> 01:28:40.878
So President Business
is the bad guy?

1889
01:28:48.740 --> 01:28:50.092
If...

1890
01:28:51.451 --> 01:28:54.054
If the construction guy...

1891
01:28:55.121 --> 01:28:56.861
said something to
President Business...

1892
01:29:00.710 --> 01:29:02.562
what would he say?

1893
01:29:09.219 --> 01:29:10.536
You...

1894
01:29:11.721 --> 01:29:14.199
don't have to be...

1895
01:29:15.016 --> 01:29:16.459
the bad guy.

1896
01:29:18.895 --> 01:29:19.666
You...

1897
01:29:20.355 --> 01:29:22.207
are the most talented...

1898
01:29:23.149 --> 01:29:24.592
most interesting...

1899
01:29:25.902 --> 01:29:29.302
and most extraordinary
person in the universe.

1900
01:29:30.824 --> 01:29:34.098
And you are capable
of amazing things...

1901
01:29:34.744 --> 01:29:38.599
because you are The Special.

1902
01:29:41.877 --> 01:29:43.320
And so am I.

1903
01:29:46.172 --> 01:29:47.990
<i>And so is everyone.</i>

1904
01:29:49.342 --> 01:29:51.490
<i>The prophecy is made-up...</i>

1905
01:29:52.220 --> 01:29:54.163
<i>but it's also true.</i>

1906
01:29:54.723 --> 01:29:56.075
It's about all of us.

1907
01:29:56.683 --> 01:29:59.161
Right now, it's about you.

1908
01:30:00.395 --> 01:30:01.838
And you...

1909
01:30:02.856 --> 01:30:04.424
still...

1910
01:30:05.066 --> 01:30:07.339
can change everything.

1911
01:30:32.469 --> 01:30:34.446
Oh, we got a hugger.

1912
01:30:36.890 --> 01:30:38.082
Be careful.

1913
01:30:38.224 --> 01:30:41.703
I have been told it might explode.

1914
01:30:52.614 --> 01:30:53.806
Phew.

1915
01:30:54.741 --> 01:30:57.185
Emmet, thank you.

1916
01:30:57.327 --> 01:30:59.896
And I just want you to know,
from the bottom of my heart...

1917
01:31:00.246 --> 01:31:01.893
from this moment forward...

1918
01:31:02.040 --> 01:31:04.484
I solemnly promise
that I will never...

1919
01:31:13.969 --> 01:31:15.537
Emmet!

1920
01:31:15.679 --> 01:31:18.077
Hey, everyone! Is everyone okay?

1921
01:31:18.765 --> 01:31:19.866
Where's Lucy?

1922
01:31:20.308 --> 01:31:21.159
Emmet!

1923
01:31:21.309 --> 01:31:22.831
Lucy!

1924
01:31:25.897 --> 01:31:27.294
We did it.

1925
01:31:33.238 --> 01:31:35.591
Oh. Uh, Emmet, wait.

1926
01:31:36.074 --> 01:31:38.848
Batman, there's something
I need to say to you.

1927
01:31:38.994 --> 01:31:40.687
No. Wyldstyle...

1928
01:31:40.829 --> 01:31:42.146
I mean...

1929
01:31:42.747 --> 01:31:44.224
Lucy.

1930
01:31:45.250 --> 01:31:47.478
He's the hero you deserve.

1931
01:31:50.505 --> 01:31:52.653
- Uh...
- Thanks, Batman.

1932
01:32:04.102 --> 01:32:06.876
I liked Emmet before it was cool.

1933
01:32:07.605 --> 01:32:09.753
Whoops, I have the
antidote for the Kragle.

1934
01:32:09.899 --> 01:32:11.467
How did that happen?

1935
01:32:11.609 --> 01:32:13.131
Yay!

1936
01:32:13.278 --> 01:32:14.550
- De-Kragler.
- Watch this.

1937
01:32:14.696 --> 01:32:15.922
- Yay!
- Oh, Mommy, Daddy.

1938
01:32:16.072 --> 01:32:17.094
You're okay!

1939
01:32:17.240 --> 01:32:18.933
- Oh, son!
- Hi, Mom. Hi, Dad.

1940
01:32:20.326 --> 01:32:22.178
<i>We're okay, son. Ha, ha.</i>

1941
01:32:22.328 --> 01:32:25.056
Guys, time to come up for dinner.
It's Taco Tuesday, your favorite.

1942
01:32:25.206 --> 01:32:28.435
- Okay, honey. We'll be up in a sec.
- Yeah, we'll be up in a sec!

1943
01:32:28.835 --> 01:32:30.608
- I gotta tell you something.
- What?

1944
01:32:30.754 --> 01:32:32.838
Now that I'm letting you
come down here and play...

1945
01:32:32.839 --> 01:32:34.757
guess who else gets to
come down here and play?

1946
01:32:34.758 --> 01:32:36.235
- Who?
- Your sister.

1947
01:32:36.384 --> 01:32:37.235
What?

1948
01:32:37.385 --> 01:32:39.565
Well, things sure have a way
of working out smoothly.

1949
01:32:39.596 --> 01:32:40.413
Am I right, guys?

1950
01:32:40.555 --> 01:32:42.407
What?

1951
01:32:47.604 --> 01:32:50.127
We're from the Planet Duplon.

1952
01:32:50.273 --> 01:32:53.593
We are here to destroy you.

1953
01:32:55.070 --> 01:32:56.717
Oh, man.

1954
01:37:57.246 --> 01:37:59.644
<i>Yes, this is real music.</i>

1955
01:38:00.708 --> 01:38:02.435
<i>Dark, brooding...</i>

1956
01:38:02.794 --> 01:38:04.521
<i>important...</i>

1957
01:38:04.670 --> 01:38:06.113
<i>groundbreaking.</i>

1958
01:38:07.632 --> 01:38:08.779
<i>Check out the lyrics.</i>

1959
01:38:11.344 --> 01:38:12.866
<i>Darkness</i>

1960
01:38:14.389 --> 01:38:16.537
<i>No parents</i>

1961
01:38:19.143 --> 01:38:21.041
<i>Continued darkness</i>

1962
01:38:21.187 --> 01:38:23.039
<i>More darkness. Get it?</i>

1963
01:38:23.189 --> 01:38:25.166
<i>The opposite of light</i>

1964
01:38:25.775 --> 01:38:27.297
<i>Black hole</i>

1965
01:38:27.985 --> 01:38:29.302
<i>Curtains drawn</i>

1966
01:38:30.780 --> 01:38:32.473
<i>In the basement</i>

1967
01:38:33.491 --> 01:38:35.184
<i>Middle of the night</i>

1968
01:38:36.452 --> 01:38:38.554
<i>Blacked-out windows</i>

1969
01:38:40.123 --> 01:38:41.645
<i>Other places that are dark</i>

1970
01:38:43.793 --> 01:38:45.110
<i>Black suit</i>

1971
01:38:46.212 --> 01:38:47.814
<i>Black coffee</i>

1972
01:38:48.464 --> 01:38:50.737
<i>You get it. That's
just the first verse.</i>

1973
01:38:50.883 --> 01:38:52.826
<i>Darkness</i>

1974
01:38:54.011 --> 01:38:55.988
<i>No parents</i>

1975
01:38:57.140 --> 01:38:58.492
<i>Super rich</i>

1976
01:38:59.934 --> 01:39:01.707
<i>Kind of makes it better</i>
